    "reach_definition": "REACH for each candidate is the sum of block population over 2020 census blocks that are (a) currently unserved (distance to nearest naloxone supply > 1609.344 m, i.e. > 1 mile) AND (b) within 805 m of the candidate storefront. This is 'unserved residents within a half-mile walk of this storefront.' Computed with a cKDTree spatial join in EPSG:32138 (both candidate points and block internal points projected to meters).",
